{
  "uid": "url-short-refresh",
  "title": "url-shortener · hotkey-refresh",
  "tags": [
    "url-short"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "L1 hit ratio during hot-key refresh",
      "description": "full replace(전체 무효화 후 재적재) vs delta(바뀐 것만)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(urlcache_hits_total{application=\"redirect\",layer=\"l1\"}[15s])) / clamp_min(sum by (instance) (rate(urlcache_admission_total{application=\"redirect\"}[15s])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "l1_hit_ratio ({{instance}})"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "min",
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "l1_hit_ratio (redirect-2)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "l1_hit_ratio{refresh=\"full replace\"}"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "l1_hit_ratio (redirect-1)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "l1_hit_ratio{refresh=\"delta\"}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "refresh cost · KEEP 95,253 (95.6%) · ADD 4,336 · REMOVE 4,336",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| metric | full replace | delta | change |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| pub/sub 메시지 크기 | 973 KB | 67 KB | **-93%** |\n| 갱신당 L1 재적재 건수 | 99,589 | 4,336 | **-96%** |\n| 갱신 시점 Redis 조회 QPS | 206 | 98 | **-52%** |\n| L1 히트율 최저값 | 40.3% | 77.1% | **+36.8%p** |\n| 히트율 평균 (15분) | 64.6% | 79.3% | **+14.7%p** |\n\n*측정: redirect 2대에 nginx로 같은 트래픽(900 RPS, Zipf) · 4분 간격 갱신 3회 · full replace = 전체 무효화 후 재적재, delta = 바뀐 것만*"
      }
    }
  ]
}